I walk out into the small kitchen.
My travel bag stands on the floor.
I open the bag.
There are many things in the bag.
My favorite mugs lie in the bag.
I take the mugs out.
There is a cupboard above the counter.
I put the mugs in the cupboard.
Now they stand on the shelf.
I also have a red electric kettle.
It lies in the bag under a thick sweater.
I take the electric kettle out.
I put it on the kitchen counter.
Now there stands a red electric kettle right by the sink.
There also lies a box of tea in the bag.
I take the box and place it by the electric kettle.
Now the kitchen is almost ready.
I look forward to a cup of tea later.
